{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大食いメンバー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN50DWAB57AZWY733F3YJ5H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nレアな欅ジャージ!\nほんとに、楽しかったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの企画から麺の魅力にハマり、\n今、お蕎麦にはまっています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN50G5GQDBC0WEF0EVXWSC5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n夏だなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN50HME9YTHGRTPBVDCDDYT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n夏だなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中でお蕎麦の汁を麦茶だと思って飲んじゃったのは秘密(￣b￣)ｼｰｯ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑いけど冷房のつけっぱなしは気をつけてね{{ (>_<) }}"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN50K2GEJ4PDXRQ14FJXZX2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑さなんかに負けない!に使っていいよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ!\nこれは!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺーちゃんの落書きだ!!!!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN50N2T6Y0TV9GMB0FB1X8G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nぺ〜〜\nLARMEのモデル、おめでとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LARMEはとても大好きな雑誌なのでこれからもぺーちゃんも応援しつつ、愛読していこうと思いますヾ(●´∇`●)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺーは普段大人っぽい服を着てるのを見ることが多いのでLARMEで可愛い衣装や髪型、メイクをしてるのを見ると、こんなぺーもあるのか!!ってなります(笑)\nとくにハーフツインのぺーが最高でした!!!\nこれから、忙しくなると思うけど応援してるよー!(o尸ﾞ`・ω・´)o尸ﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}